  <p id="c-nanshi-064-jiangziyi-kin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-064-jiangziyi-kin:p001:m0000" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AA">江子一</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-064-jiangziyi-kin:p001:m0004" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AA">元亮</persName>，濟陽考城人，晉散騎常侍<persName id="c-nanshi-064-jiangziyi-kin:p001:m0018" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w">統</persName>之七世孫也。父<persName id="c-nanshi-064-jiangziyi-kin:p001:m0026" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w_*****A">法成</persName>，奉朝請。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-064-jiangziyi-kin:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-064-jiangziyi-kin:p002:m0000" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AA">子一</persName>及弟尚書左丞<persName id="c-nanshi-064-jiangziyi-kin:p002:m0008" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AB">子四</persName>、東宮直殿主帥<persName id="c-nanshi-064-jiangziyi-kin:p002:m0017" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AC">子五</persName>並力戰直前，</p>
